# Data — never commit real data. Real data lives in the team's Google Drive.
# (tests/fixtures/ is a separate top-level path and is tracked normally.)
# data/00_raw/ stays untracked via this blanket rule (no exception below).
data/*

# Exception (Phase 7, decided 2026-08-24): the built warehouse + persisted
# models are derived build artifacts, not raw source data. Streamlit
# Community Cloud deploys straight from GitHub with no persistent mounted
# storage, so the dashboard needs these committed to run.
!data/30_warehouse/
data/30_warehouse/*
!data/30_warehouse/warehouse.duckdb

!data/50_models/
data/50_models/*
!data/50_models/*.joblib
!data/50_models/*.pt

# Exception (Phase 7 Batch 2, 2026-08-25): monthly rainfall forecast
# (rain_lead0..5) has no home in the star schema -- CLAUDE.md §8's warehouse
# design never gave it a dimension/fact, a real gap the Weather Impact page
# (BQ2) needs filled. This is the Phase 2 *cleaned staging* output (not raw
# data, not recomputed by the dashboard), committed for the same
# no-persistent-storage reason as the warehouse file above. Documented on
# the Weather Impact page itself; a future phase should properly promote
# this into the warehouse as a conformed dimension.
!data/10_staging/
data/10_staging/*
!data/10_staging/rainfall.parquet

# Exception (Phase 8, 2026-08-25): the AI insight cache -- narratives +
# their verification records for a fixed scope set (rri.insight.cache),
# same no-persistent-storage reason as the warehouse/model files above.
# Streamlit Community Cloud serves this file directly, no live Anthropic
# API call and no key needed at serve time. ai_verification_log.csv (the
# running audit trail, regenerated on every cache build) is NOT committed --
# same treatment as logs/ below.
!data/60_insights/
data/60_insights/*
!data/60_insights/insights_cache.json

# Warehouse / DB files (elsewhere in the repo — not the exception above)
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Logs
logs/
*.jsonl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
.eggs/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg

